{"canonical_record_sha256": "2216c778124c5aadf808587d36682e783641b671b94b2389560727b954e4e5cf", "classification_basis": "tolkappiyam_mapping", "concept_evidence_id": "gram.r15.9fc0de162e4c26aab0cda9f2", "concept_id": "knowledge.grammar.phonology", "confidence": "high", "dimension": "knowledge_technology", "evidence_class": "GRAMMATICAL_CONCEPT_EVIDENCE", "notes": "The நூற்பா formally defines the scope/count of `எழுத்து`, from `அகரம்` through `னகர`, together with three dependent forms. This is grammatical letter-system evidence, not a historical technology claim.", "record_id": "tolkappiyam-0001", "review_status": "reviewed", "schema_version": "0.3.0", "source_location": "markdown:canonical-body:1:0-4:38", "surface_form": "எழுத்து எனப்படுப\nஅகரம் முதல்\nனகர இறுவாய் முப்பஃது என்ப\nசார்ந்து வரல் மரபின் மூன்று அலங்கடையே.", "work_id": "tolkappiyam"}
