{"canonical_record_sha256": "d0ea249e65b5cf3f8086c3f1780f103189f881f5b6c55fbd43f600089c8bd179", "classification_basis": "tolkappiyam_mapping", "concept_evidence_id": "gram.r15.937ab75b983820a616ac639b", "concept_id": "knowledge.grammar.phonology", "confidence": "high", "dimension": "knowledge_technology", "evidence_class": "GRAMMATICAL_CONCEPT_EVIDENCE", "notes": "The நூற்பா formally classifies அ, இ, உ, எ, ஒ as குற்றெழுத்து and assigns one அளபு of phonological duration. `அளபு` here is part of grammatical sound measurement, not a general historical time claim.", "record_id": "tolkappiyam-0003", "review_status": "reviewed", "schema_version": "0.3.0", "source_location": "markdown:canonical-body:1:0-4:37", "surface_form": "அவற்றுள்,\nஅ இ உ\nஎ ஒ என்னும் அப் பால் ஐந்தும்\nஓர் அளபு இசைக்கும் குற்றெழுத்து என்ப.", "work_id": "tolkappiyam"}
{"canonical_record_sha256": "949fc62030845149a8f4f22380167ae294f80490456e234649004c67d6e39a19", "classification_basis": "tolkappiyam_mapping", "concept_evidence_id": "gram.r15.847495d4d323c09612585d88", "concept_id": "knowledge.grammar.phonology", "confidence": "high", "dimension": "knowledge_technology", "evidence_class": "GRAMMATICAL_CONCEPT_EVIDENCE", "notes": "The நூற்பா formally classifies ஆ, ஈ, ஊ, ஏ, ஐ, ஓ, ஔ as நெட்டெழுத்து and assigns two அளபு of phonological duration.", "record_id": "tolkappiyam-0004", "review_status": "reviewed", "schema_version": "0.3.0", "source_location": "markdown:canonical-body:1:0-3:37", "surface_form": "ஆ ஈ ஊ ஏ ஐ\nஓ ஔ என்னும் அப் பால் ஏழும்\nஈர் அளபு இசைக்கும் நெட்டெழுத்து என்ப.", "work_id": "tolkappiyam"}
